// 
// DESCRIPTION: A polymorphic function which retrieves from the 
// data the information that was stored in the map
// and prints out each pokemon
//
// Parameters: Pokemon *pokemon: Each child class pokemon with
// the given nickname
//
// Return values: none
// 
****************************************************************/ 
